{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris Break is a game designed to help you unwind. Featuring a variety of Tetris modes, it\u2019s all about delivering a soothing and enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/brain_massage.png?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/color_clear.gif?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We\u2019ve preserved the essence of classic Tetris gameplay, including standard wall kicks and T-Spins. Relive the nostalgia while pulling off advanced moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/classic.png?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/tspin.gif?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With additional modes, our focus is on easing your mind and providing a true brain massage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/various_modes.png?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/drilling_all_clear.gif?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite your friends for online or offline play, whether cooperative or competitive. Share enjoyable moments together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/play_together.png?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/duel_40line.gif?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/coop_color_clear.gif?t=1744952745\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is Tetris Break, a game that lets you take a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/extras/duel_drilling.gif?t=1744952745\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668530?t=1744952745","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/f41e7e9228fa1182f7e048ed01999ad5ef21f1c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744952745","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/f538d4f59a6f660c6682325e297a269501286921/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744952745","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668530/f538d4f59a6f660c6682325e297a269501286921/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744952745","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tetris Break is a game designed to help you unwind. Featuring a variety of Tetris modes, it\u2019s all about deliveri